# Fetched competitor binaries and source artifacts (pinned in tools.lock.json).
.tools/
# Fetched and generated corpora. Never vendored: dbpedia-live is CC-BY-SA, and
# DBLP republishes in place, so a committed copy silently becomes a different
# corpus from the one the URL serves.
.corpora/
# Run outputs. The interesting ones get promoted to bench-baselines/ by hand.
.results/
# Recorded corpus hashes — machine-local, since which dump you fetched depends
# on the day you fetched it.
corpora.local.json
# Helper build artifacts.
harness/target/
